{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Starting with IndoorSDK 1.7.0, points of interest (POIs) are shown with ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"dynamic markers","type":"text"}]},{"text":". When the user zooms in close enough, a small icon expands into a larger, richer card that carries more information: the brand image of the place, or — for certain operational categories — an automatically built badge with the relevant numbers (boarding gates, check-in desks and baggage reclaim belts).","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This article is aimed at the people who ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"create and maintain POIs","type":"text"}]},{"text":". The visual result depends directly on the data you provide (the POI name and its brand image), so a few simple conventions make a big difference in the final experience for the traveller.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"aside","style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Dynamic markers appear only at close zoom levels. When the map is zoomed out, POIs keep showing the classic small icon so the map stays readable.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"Note"},{"type":"heading","text":"How dynamic POIs work for all categories","level":2,"anchor":"How-dynamic-POIs-work-for-all-categories"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For most categories, the dynamic marker shows the ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"brand image","type":"text"}]},{"text":" associated with the POI inside a rounded card.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The SDK takes the brand image you provide for the POI, places it on a white card with rounded corners, and crops it to fit a square. To get the best result:","type":"text"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use a square image whenever possible."}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" Non-square images are centred and cropped to a square, so important content near the edges (especially top and bottom) may be trimmed. Keep logos and key elements centred.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Provide a high-resolution image."}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" The card is rendered larger than the classic icon, so low-resolution images will look blurry when expanded.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Prefer images with a clean, simple background."}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" The image sits on a white card, so logos with transparent or white backgrounds blend in naturally.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Avoid images that already include their own frame, border or rounded card."}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" The SDK adds its own card and border; an image that already has one will look like “a card inside a card”.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"aside","style":"tip","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If a POI has no brand image, it simply keeps the standard category icon when zoomed in. Nothing breaks — you just don’t get the richer presentation."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Tip"},{"type":"heading","text":"Operational categories: gates, desks and baggage reclaim","level":2,"anchor":"Operational-categories-gates-desks-and-baggage-reclaim"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Three categories are special. Instead of a brand image, the SDK ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"builds the marker automatically from the POI name"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":", drawing the category icon together with the number (or numbers) it finds in the name:","type":"text"}]},{"header":"row","type":"table","rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Category"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"What the badge shows","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Number format expected in the name","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Boarding gates","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Gate icon + gate number(s)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A letter followed by 1–3 digits, e.g. ","type":"text"},{"code":"B12","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Check-in desks","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Desk icon + desk number(s)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A number of 1 to 3 digits, e.g. ","type":"text"},{"code":"6","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"25","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"902","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Baggage reclaim","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Belt icon + belt number(s)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Any number, e.g. ","type":"text"},{"code":"3","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"15","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Because the badge is generated from the name, "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"the way you write the POI name controls what the traveller sees."}],"type":"strong"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Single value","type":"heading","anchor":"Single-value","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If the name contains a single matching number, the badge shows that one number, large and centred next to the category icon.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Puerta B12"},{"type":"text","text":" → badge shows "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"B12"}]}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Mostrador 6"},{"type":"text","text":" → badge shows "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"6"}]}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Cinta 3"},{"type":"text","text":" → badge shows "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"3"}]}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"text":"A range of two values","type":"heading","anchor":"A-range-of-two-values","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If the name contains ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"two","type":"text"}]},{"text":" numbers, the SDK understands it as a range and shows both, one above the other:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When the two numbers are "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"consecutive"}]},{"type":"text","text":" (and share the same letter prefix), they are shown stacked, with no symbol between them — e.g. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"B12"},{"type":"text","text":" over "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"B13"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When they are "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"not consecutive"}]},{"type":"text","text":", the SDK draws three dots "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"..."},{"type":"text","text":" between them to indicate “from the first to the last” — e.g. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"902"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"..."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"905"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Examples:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Puertas B12-B13"},{"type":"text","text":" → "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"B12 \/ B13"}]},{"type":"text","text":" (consecutive)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Puertas B12-B15"},{"type":"text","text":" → "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"B12 \/ … \/ B15"}]},{"type":"text","text":" (range)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Mostradores 902-905"},{"type":"text","text":" → "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"902 \/ … \/ 905"}]}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"name":"Tip","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"To represent a block of positions, name the POI with just the ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"first and last"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" number of the block. That is exactly what the badge is designed to show.","type":"text"}]}],"type":"aside","style":"tip"},{"text":"Three or more values: no badge","type":"heading","anchor":"Three-or-more-values-no-badge","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If the name contains ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"three or more","type":"text"}]},{"text":" numbers, the SDK does ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"not","type":"text"}]},{"text":" generate a badge and the POI falls back to the standard category icon.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This is intentional: a badge can only honestly show one value or a “first…last” range. Picking two numbers out of a longer list would mislead the traveller (for example, showing ","type":"text"},{"code":"902…904","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for a desk actually named ","type":"text"},{"code":"902 904 906 908","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":").","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"name":"Important","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If you need a single marker to cover several non-contiguous positions, be aware it will not get a generated badge. Prefer either one POI per position, or a name expressing a clean first–last range.","type":"text"}]}],"type":"aside","style":"important"},{"text":"Naming recommendations (summary)","type":"heading","anchor":"Naming-recommendations-summary","level":3},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Put the gate \/ desk \/ belt number clearly in the name."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For a range, include exactly "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"two"}]},{"type":"text","text":" numbers: the first and the last."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Keep the same letter prefix on both ends of a gate range ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"B12"},{"type":"text","text":"–"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"B15"},{"type":"text","text":", not "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"B12"},{"type":"text","text":"–"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"C15"},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Don’t list three or more numbers if you want the badge to appear."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Extra descriptive words in the name are fine — the SDK only reads the numbers."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"text":"Frequently asked questions","type":"heading","anchor":"Frequently-asked-questions","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"The badge for my gate\/desk didn’t change after I edited the data.","type":"text"}]},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Generated badges are cached on the device for performance. They refresh automatically when the airport data is updated or when the app is updated to a version with a new badge design. A reinstall always regenerates them.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"My brand image looks cropped.","type":"text"}]},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The image is cropped to a square. Re-export it square, with the important content centred.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Nothing rich shows up for my POI.","type":"text"}]},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Either the POI has no brand image (for normal categories) or, for gates\/desks\/baggage, the name has no number — or has three or more numbers. Review the naming recommendations above.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"article","sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.geographica.IndoorSDK\/documentation\/IndoorSDK"]]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Get the best out of the rich POI markers shown on the map."}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Essentials","title":"Essentials","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.geographica.IndoorSDK\/documentation\/IndoorSDK\/GettingStarted","doc:\/\/com.geographica.IndoorSDK\/documentation\/IndoorSDK\/SharePosition","doc:\/\/com.geographica.IndoorSDK\/documentation\/IndoorSDK\/OutdoorNavigation","doc:\/\/com.geographica.IndoorSDK\/documentation\/IndoorSDK\/Geofence","doc:\/\/com.geographica.IndoorSDK\/documentation\/IndoorSDK\/ChatbotIntegration","doc:\/\/com.geographica.IndoorSDK\/documentation\/IndoorSDK\/IndoorModule"],"generated":true}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/indoorsdk\/dynamicpois"]},{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/indoorsdk\/dynamicpois"]}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"IndoorSDK"}],"roleHeading":"Article","platforms":[{"introducedAt":"1.7","name":"IndoorSDK","beta":false}],"role":"article","title":"Dynamic POIs"},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.geographica.IndoorSDK\/documentation\/IndoorSDK\/DynamicPois","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"references":{"doc://com.geographica.IndoorSDK/documentation/IndoorSDK/SharePosition":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/indoorsdk\/shareposition","title":"Share Position","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.geographica.IndoorSDK\/documentation\/IndoorSDK\/SharePosition","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Let your users share the position"}],"role":"article","kind":"article"},"doc://com.geographica.IndoorSDK/documentation/IndoorSDK/OutdoorNavigation":{"title":"Outdoor navigation","kind":"article","type":"topic","role":"article","url":"\/documentation\/indoorsdk\/outdoornavigation","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.geographica.IndoorSDK\/documentation\/IndoorSDK\/OutdoorNavigation","abstract":[{"text":"Combine outdoor navigation with dedicated Apps with IndoorSDK","type":"text"}]},"doc://com.geographica.IndoorSDK/documentation/IndoorSDK/ChatbotIntegration":{"title":"Chatbot integrations","kind":"article","type":"topic","role":"article","url":"\/documentation\/indoorsdk\/chatbotintegration","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.geographica.IndoorSDK\/documentation\/IndoorSDK\/ChatbotIntegration","abstract":[{"text":"Improving access to indoor maps functionalities","type":"text"}]},"doc://com.geographica.IndoorSDK/documentation/IndoorSDK/IndoorModule":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.geographica.IndoorSDK\/documentation\/IndoorSDK\/IndoorModule","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Main model class of IndoorSDK"}],"url":"\/documentation\/indoorsdk\/indoormodule","title":"IndoorModule","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"IndoorModule","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"IndoorModule"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol"},"doc://com.geographica.IndoorSDK/documentation/IndoorSDK/GettingStarted":{"title":"Getting started","kind":"article","type":"topic","role":"article","url":"\/documentation\/indoorsdk\/gettingstarted","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.geographica.IndoorSDK\/documentation\/IndoorSDK\/GettingStarted","abstract":[{"text":"Add IndoorSDK to your app.","type":"text"}]},"doc://com.geographica.IndoorSDK/documentation/IndoorSDK/Geofence":{"type":"topic","title":"Geofence","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.geographica.IndoorSDK\/documentation\/IndoorSDK\/Geofence","url":"\/documentation\/indoorsdk\/geofence","role":"article","abstract":[{"text":"Manage in your app registered region by AENA.","type":"text"}],"kind":"article"},"doc://com.geographica.IndoorSDK/documentation/IndoorSDK":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","title":"IndoorSDK","role":"collection","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Indoor Maping and navigation"}],"url":"\/documentation\/indoorsdk","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.geographica.IndoorSDK\/documentation\/IndoorSDK"}},"variantOverrides":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"patch":[{"path":"\/identifier\/interfaceLanguage","op":"replace","value":"occ"},{"path":"\/topicSections","op":"add","value":null},{"path":"\/seeAlsoSections","op":"replace","value":[{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.geographica.IndoorSDK\/documentation\/IndoorSDK\/GettingStarted","doc:\/\/com.geographica.IndoorSDK\/documentation\/IndoorSDK\/SharePosition","doc:\/\/com.geographica.IndoorSDK\/documentation\/IndoorSDK\/OutdoorNavigation","doc:\/\/com.geographica.IndoorSDK\/documentation\/IndoorSDK\/Geofence","doc:\/\/com.geographica.IndoorSDK\/documentation\/IndoorSDK\/ChatbotIntegration","doc:\/\/com.geographica.IndoorSDK\/documentation\/IndoorSDK\/IndoorModule"],"title":"Essentials","anchor":"Essentials"}]},{"path":"\/references\/doc:~1~1com.geographica.IndoorSDK~1documentation~1IndoorSDK~1IndoorModule\/title","op":"replace","value":"IndoorModule"},{"path":"\/references\/doc:~1~1com.geographica.IndoorSDK~1documentation~1IndoorSDK~1IndoorModule\/fragments","op":"replace","value":[{"text":"IndoorModule","kind":"identifier"}]},{"path":"\/references\/doc:~1~1com.geographica.IndoorSDK~1documentation~1IndoorSDK~1IndoorModule\/navigatorTitle","op":"replace","value":[{"text":"IndoorModule","kind":"identifier"}